{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方海關破9宗快艇走私香煙案拘7人\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CUST-CIGAR-261029-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方及海關採取聯合行動搗破9宗走私香煙案件，拘捕7人。</p><p>行動中檢獲逾2000萬支懷疑私煙，估計市值約9500萬元，並扣留多艘快艇及車輛調查。</p><p>警方表示透過情報分析，發現有不法分子利用快艇將大批私煙由境外偷運來港，並透過貨車轉運至偏僻停車場或倉庫暫存、分拆及分銷私煙，於是聯同海關在本月13日至周二期間進行多次執法行動。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:47.679867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:13:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.400089+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:20.832041+00:00","content_hash":"047b51aa454c9612c6f35c78ff627b9564e77025265494dc7b26d8cf015192a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:47.679867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}